To verify the sustainability of the system, we profiled the power consumption of the Edge Node under various loads. A reference-grade UMA edge platform (Apple M2) is used to establish upper-bound performance and energy characteristics (Table I) \cite{b16}. These measurements are included solely to demonstrate feasibility for continuous edge operation and do not constitute an energy optimization contribution.

